Third-party software that this repository does not contain
----------------------------------------------------------

The build links Microsoft's Azure Kinect Sensor SDK (libk4a, libk4arecord) and,
for durchblick-k4abt, the Azure Kinect Body Tracking SDK. The Sensor SDK's source
code is under the MIT licence quoted above. At run time libk4a
loads the depth engine (libdepthengine). The depth engine and the Body
Tracking SDK are proprietary Microsoft binaries under the Microsoft Software
License Terms that come with them. You install them separately; this
repository contains no part of them.
